{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP.nextIP\"><span class=\"name\">IP</span>.<span class=\"name\">nextIP</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">flags</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Vector/Basic.html#Vector\">Vector</a> <a href=\"./Shenzhen/Instruction.html#ConditionalFlag\">ConditionalFlag</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">curr</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cond</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Shenzhen/Instruction.html#ConditionalState\">ConditionalState</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Find the index `i` of the next instruction **greater than** `curr` that\nis enabled according to `flags[i]` and `cond`, looping back around from\n`i = m - 1` to `i = 0` if necessary. `none` if no such index exists.\n(We don't use the `IP` constructor because we want to be able to return `none`\nfor `m > 0`.) ","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP.nextIP","kind":"def","line":33,"name":"IP.nextIP","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC/IP.lean#L33-L48"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP.instCoeFin\"><span class=\"name\">IP</span>.<span class=\"name\">instCoeFin</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Coe.html#Coe\">Coe</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP\">IP</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP.instCoeFin","kind":"instance","line":31,"name":"IP.instCoeFin","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC/IP.lean#L31-L31"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP.instInhabited\"><span class=\"name\">IP</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabited</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP\">IP</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Shenzhen/MC/IP.html#IP.instInhabited","kind":"instance","line":28,"name":"IP.instInhabited","sourceLink":"https://github.com/a2435191/shenzhen-lean/blob/48728217f18fc01d439991efb2b77ce532d5d756/Shenzhen/MC/IP.lean#L28-L29"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"